  steps:
    1. Generate the D4-symmetric 16x16 output by filling the 36-cell fundamental domain (upper-left triangle of TL quadrant) with 5-8 random non-black non-green colors, then reflecting to full grid.
    2. Place 2 rectangular green blobs (each 2-4 x 2-4) at random positions. Verify that no LR+UD orbit (4-cell group) has more than 2 cells covered by green across both blobs combined. Retry placement if violated.
    3. Replace blob cells with GREEN to produce the input.
```
